    "True period-dividing-n label point spaces are equivalent by identity of the actual Fin n word and have equal cardinal",
    "finitePrunedGraph carries an actual original edge decision supplier and every vertex has an original labeled outgoing edge",
    "Every state of the already pruned graph remains after a second complete pruning; Boolean right-live and realized-factor queries are invariant"
